    "text": "An electron revolves around the nucleus in a circular path with angular momentum $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{L}} . \\mathrm{A}$ uniform magnetic field $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{B}}$ is applied perpendicular to the plane of its orbit. If the electron experiences a torque $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{T}}$, then"
  },
