      "text": "$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{T}}$ is anti-parallel to $\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{L}}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{T}} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{L}}=0$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Angle between $\\vec{T}$ and $\\vec{L}$ is $45^{\\circ}$",
      "is_correct": false
